looking is an action.

Understand look as looking.
Understand l as looking.
$ rule (carry-out looking)
    (
        - queue
            stmt-start
                carry-out-enacting looking
            stmt-end
            $( $queue )*
            
        location of player is $here
        description of $here is $description
    )
    (
        queue
            stmt-start
                say $description
            stmt-end
            $( $queue )*
    )
